  "question": {
    "text": "A particle describes a horizontal circle in a conical funnel, whose inner surface is smooth, with a speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.5</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. What is the height (in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cm</mi></math>) of the plane of the circle from the vertex of the funnel?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
